...Brussel Sprouts, Turnip greens, Asparagus, Celery, Cabbage, Okra, Honeydew Melon, Limes, Green bell peppers, green chiles...
... Sprouts ບຣູເຊວ, ຜັກຂຽວ turnip, Asparagus, celery, ຄາບາຈ໌
, Okra, Honeydew Melon, Limes, ຫມາກ ໄມ້ສີຂຽວ, chiles ສີຂຽວ...

