[RACHEL]
Noodle.
ໂນດເລ.

417
00:24:21,900 --> 00:24:23,900
[ADAM]
What?
ຫຍັງ?

418
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:26,400
[RACHEL]
The dog.
ຫມາ.

419
00:24:26,900 --> 00:24:28,900
[ADAM]
Ignore him. 47.
ບໍ່ສົນໃຈລາວ. 47.

420
